{
 "id": "create:chassis/radial",
 "schematic": "chassis/radial",
 "schematicNamespace": "create",
 "title": "Attaching blocks using Radial Chassis",
 "texts": {
  "text_1": "Radial Chassis connect to identical Chassis blocks in a row",
  "text_2": "When one is moved by a Contraption, the others are dragged with it",
  "text_3": "The side faces of a Radial Chassis can be made Sticky",
  "text_4": "Click again to make all other sides sticky",
  "text_5": "Sneak and Right-Click with an empty hand to remove the slime",
  "text_6": "Whenever a Block is next to a sticky face...",
  "text_7": "...it will attach all reachable blocks within a radius on that layer",
  "text_8": "Using a Wrench, a precise Radius can be specified for this chassis",
  "text_9": "Blocks not reachable by any sticky face will not attach"
 },
 "tags": [
  "create:contraption_assembly"
 ],
